Subject: text input and textarea v2: a full-width modifier

What: `text-input-v2--full-width` and `textarea-v2--full-width` size the control
to its container, beside the 280px design width the sheets set.
Why: the sheets load unlayered, so no layered utility can widen a control; every
form field in the app fills its column, as the v1 text field (width: 100%) did.

diff --git a/src/v2/components/text-input-v2.css b/src/v2/components/text-input-v2.css
index 1bdf3c3b393e21bdc7384bef81eed1dc9f9d3c21..14278467663c2e78b004dca6d210ea9e973bf95a 100644
--- a/src/v2/components/text-input-v2.css
+++ b/src/v2/components/text-input-v2.css
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+.ui-text-input-v2.text-input-v2--full-width {
+  width: 100%;
+}
+
 .ui-text-input-v2 {
   box-sizing: border-box;
   display: flex;
